{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can type, you can fire a gun.<br>If you can fire a gun, you can master all kinds of guns.<br>If you can master them all, you can describe even more awesome ones.<br>In short, if you can type, you\u2019ll have a blast here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/fc25eb5e764169f59218ab3f2e90cc71.webp?t=1768841893\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type to unleash your will!</strong>\u00a0In <i>[Typing Break]</i>, your typing speed directly determines the density of your firepower. Whether you are a &quot;Typing God&quot; seeking the ultimate speed limit, or a casual player looking to vent some stress, you will find your own rhythm amidst the screen-filling bullet hell and explosive effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/4257d16105f1fbd201eda43099261844.poster.avif?t=1768841893\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/4257d16105f1fbd201eda43099261844.webm?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/4257d16105f1fbd201eda43099261844.mp4?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/d3b48220c348f5b3f4acd5337b94a24c.webp?t=1768841893\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just spelling\u2014it's strategy!</strong>\u00a0<strong>Say goodbye to boring letter collisions; welcome to a laboratory of magical element reactions.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type <strong>WATER</strong>\u00a0to enchant your bullets with hydro power. Combine it with <strong>FLAME</strong>\u00a0to trigger an instant <strong>Vaporize</strong>\u00a0reaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear the screen in the blink of an eye!</strong>\u00a0Dozens of elemental combinations are waiting to be discovered, making every keystroke a dazzling explosion of magic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/8e85de59bb9b88271a2e708f84bf23de.poster.avif?t=1768841893\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/8e85de59bb9b88271a2e708f84bf23de.webm?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/8e85de59bb9b88271a2e708f84bf23de.mp4?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/f6412c7d62334bcd88f11201d514c854.webp?t=1768841893\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is one hero and one gun enough? Never! Reject cookie-cutter battles and embrace infinite possibilities through Roguelike combinations:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Talents:</strong>\u00a0Each character possesses unique <strong>Talent Skills</strong>. Accumulate <strong>EXP</strong>\u00a0in battle to unlock and upgrade their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge is Power:</strong>\u00a0Unlock and equip various &quot;Books,&quot; carrying exclusive <strong>BUFFs</strong>\u00a0to control the rhythm of every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limitless Build Experience:</strong>\u00a0Combine Character Talents with powerful Books and diverse weapons like <strong>Laser</strong>\u00a0and <strong>Disc</strong>. Every run is a brand new experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/7196828d6a9f0049f8d368eedd6008d6.poster.avif?t=1768841893\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/7196828d6a9f0049f8d368eedd6008d6.webm?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/7196828d6a9f0049f8d368eedd6008d6.mp4?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/efe38a4b1c5645521d8a650e92a6a17f.webp?t=1768841893\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the game, master the vocab? Our game natively supports multiple input modes to suit your needs:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multilingual Power: </strong>Deal critical hits using the language you know best. Let your native tongue become your strongest weapon rune.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocabulary Boot Camp: </strong>Features a built-in multilingual typing mode. Spell out words amidst intense combat\u2014this might just be the most hardcore &quot;vocabulary training ground&quot; you've ever seen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/634a71976604fc69061d846994919a6a.poster.avif?t=1768841893\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/634a71976604fc69061d846994919a6a.webm?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/634a71976604fc69061d846994919a6a.mp4?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Discord Community is now open!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features global leaderboards, along with <strong>Daily Challenges</strong>\u00a0and <strong>Weekly Challenges</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends and push their keyboards into Typing Break !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959590?t=1768841893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/b090a070359ef795b817e0fa61a74c6606b0e9f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768841893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/d89ee1204a60c62994d464daff63861aa2cca41f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768841893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/d89ee1204a60c62994d464daff63861aa2cca41f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768841893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4034770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can type, you can fire a gun.<br>If you can fire a gun, you can master all kinds of guns.<br>If you can master them all, you can describe even more awesome ones.<br>In short, if you can type, you\u2019ll have a blast here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/fc25eb5e764169f59218ab3f2e90cc71.webp?t=1768841893\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type to unleash your will!</strong>\u00a0In <i>[Typing Break]</i>, your typing speed directly determines the density of your firepower. Whether you are a &quot;Typing God&quot; seeking the ultimate speed limit, or a casual player looking to vent some stress, you will find your own rhythm amidst the screen-filling bullet hell and explosive effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/4257d16105f1fbd201eda43099261844.poster.avif?t=1768841893\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/4257d16105f1fbd201eda43099261844.webm?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/4257d16105f1fbd201eda43099261844.mp4?t=1768841893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959590/extras/d3b48220c348f5b3f4acd5337b94a24c.webp?t=1768841893\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just spelling\u2014it's strategy!</strong>\u00a0<strong>Say goodbye to boring letter collisions; welcome to a laboratory of magical element reactions.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type <strong>WATER<